import pf.Html

meta = { title: "Not here · Acme Status" }

## Where nothing is: a 404 (or the error that stopped a page), with the way back to the status.
view! = |{ status, problem }|
	<section class="missing" role="alert">
		<p class="code">{status.to_str()}</p>
		<h1>{if (status == 404) "There is no page here" else "Something went wrong"}</h1>
		<p>{problem}</p>
		<p><a href="/">Back to the status of every service</a></p>
	</section>

<style>
	.missing {
		display: grid;
		gap: var(--space-3);
		justify-items: start;
		padding: var(--space-7) 0;
	}

	.code {
		font-size: 3rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: var(--accent);
	}
</style>
